<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Casa do Controle Remoto — Catálogo</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  /* ===========================================================
     CASA DO CONTROLE REMOTO — CATÁLOGO DIGITAL
     -----------------------------------------------------------
     GUIA RÁPIDO DE EDIÇÃO (para quem for atualizar o catálogo):
     1) Fotos de produtos reais: procure por [EDITAR-FOTO] no HTML
        e troque o bloco do ícone ilustrativo por uma tag <img>.
     2) Marcas atendidas: procure por [EDITAR-MARCA] na seção
        "Marcas e compatibilidade" e substitua os textos entre
        colchetes pelas marcas reais.
     3) Preços/modelos/estoque: este catálogo foi feito de propósito
        sem esses dados. Adicione onde fizer sentido, em campos
        marcados com [EDITAR].
     4) Contatos: procure a constante CONTATO no <script> no final
        do arquivo — WhatsApp, e-mail, site e Instagram ficam ali.
     =========================================================== */

  :root{
    --bg: #F2F4F6;
    --surface: #FFFFFF;
    --surface-2: #E9EDF1;
    --ink: #10151C;
    --ink-soft: #51606F;
    --ink-faint: #8492A0;
    --navy: #17324F;
    --navy-deep: #0C1E33;
    --line: #DAE1E7;
    --signal: #FF4F32;
    --signal-soft: #FFE3DC;
    --whatsapp: #1F9E5A;
    --radius-s: 10px;
    --radius-m: 16px;
    --radius-l: 28px;
    --font-head: 'Space Grotesk', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    --font-body: 'Inter', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    --font-mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    --maxw: 1180px;
  }

  *{ box-sizing: border-box; }
  html{ scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    html{ scroll-behavior: auto; }
    *{ animation-duration: .001ms !important; animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; transition-duration: .001ms !important; }
  }

  body{
    margin:0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    line-height: 1.55;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  h1,h2,h3,h4{ font-family: var(--font-head); color: var(--navy-deep); margin: 0; }
  p{ margin: 0; }
  a{ color: inherit; }
  .wrap{ max-width: var(--maxw); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
  .visually-hidden{ position:absolute; width:1px; height:1px; overflow:hidden; clip:rect(0 0 0 0); }

  /* ---------- focus ---------- */
  a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible{
    outline: 2px solid var(--signal);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  /* ---------- top bar ---------- */
  .topbar{
    position: sticky; top:0; z-index: 50;
    background: rgba(242,244,246,0.9);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .topbar-inner{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding: 14px 0;
  }
  .brand{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; text-decoration:none; }
  .brand-mark{
    width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 9px;
    background: var(--navy-deep);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .brand-mark svg{ width:18px; height:18px; }
  .brand-name{
    font-family: var(--font-head); font-weight:600; font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--navy-deep); letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .brand-name span{ display:block; font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.68rem; color: var(--ink-faint); }

  nav.primary-nav{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:2px; }
  nav.primary-nav a{
    text-decoration:none; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 500;
    padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 999px; transition: background .15s, color .15s;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  nav.primary-nav a:hover{ background: var(--surface-2); color: var(--navy-deep); }

  .topbar-actions{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; }

  .btn{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px;
    padding: 11px 20px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight:600; font-size:0.92rem;
    text-decoration:none; border:1px solid transparent; cursor:pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    transition: transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease, background .15s ease;
  }
  .btn:active{ transform: scale(.97); }
  .btn-primary{ background: var(--navy-deep); color:#fff; }
  .btn-primary:hover{ box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(12,30,51,0.28); }
  .btn-whatsapp{ background: var(--whatsapp); color:#fff; }
  .btn-whatsapp:hover{ box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(31,158,90,0.32); }
  .btn-ghost{ background: transparent; color: var(--navy-deep); border-color: var(--line); }
  .btn-ghost:hover{ background: var(--surface-2); }
  .btn-sm{ padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 0.82rem; }
  .btn svg{ width:16px; height:16px; flex-shrink:0; }

  .menu-toggle{
    display:none; background:none; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px;
    width:42px; height:42px; align-items:center; justify-content:center; cursor:pointer;
  }
  .menu-toggle svg{ width:20px; height:20px; }

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    padding: 76px 0 88px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(560px 340px at 88% -8%, rgba(255,79,50,0.10), transparent 65%),
      var(--bg);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero-inner{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr; gap: 56px; align-items:center;
  }
  .eyebrow-badge{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    background: var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }
  .eyebrow-badge .dot{ width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%; background: var(--signal); animation: blink 2.4s ease-in-out infinite; }
  @keyframes blink{ 0%,100%{ opacity:1;} 50%{ opacity:.35; } }

  .hero h1{
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.15rem);
    line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-weight: 700;
    max-width: 15ch;
  }
  .hero-sub{
    margin-top: 20px; font-size: 1.08rem; color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 46ch;
  }
  .hero-actions{ margin-top: 32px; display:flex; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .hero-meta{
    margin-top: 40px; display:flex; gap: 28px; flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .hero-meta div{ font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-faint); }
  .hero-meta strong{ display:block; font-family: var(--font-head); font-size:1.3rem; color:var(--navy-deep); font-weight:600; }

  .remote-art{ position:relative; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
  .remote-art svg{ width: 100%; max-width: 340px; height:auto; }
  .signal-arc{ transform-origin: 168px 40px; animation: pulse 2.6s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .signal-arc.a2{ animation-delay: .3s; }
  .signal-arc.a3{ animation-delay: .6s; }
  @keyframes pulse{
    0%{ opacity:0; transform: translateY(6px) scale(.94); }
    35%{ opacity:1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
    75%{ opacity:0; transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.03); }
    100%{ opacity:0; }
  }

  /* ---------- section shell ---------- */
  section{ padding: 84px 0; }
  section.alt{ background: var(--surface); border-top:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  section.dark{ background: var(--navy-deep); color: #E7ECF1; }
  .section-head{ max-width: 640px; margin-bottom: 44px; }
  .section-head h2{ font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.6vw, 2.1rem); letter-spacing:-0.01em; }
  .section-head p{ margin-top: 14px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 1.02rem; }
  section.dark .section-head h2{ color:#fff; }
  section.dark .section-head p{ color: #B8C4CF; }

  /* ---------- about ---------- */
  .about-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr; gap: 56px; align-items:start; }
  .about-grid p + p{ margin-top: 16px; }
  .about-grid .lead{ font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--navy-deep); font-weight:500; }
  .about-grid .body-text{ color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .feature-strip{ display:grid; gap: 18px; }
  .feature-item{
    background: var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-m);
    padding: 20px 22px; display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start;
  }
  .feature-item .ic{
    width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:10px; background: var(--navy-deep);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .feature-item .ic svg{ width:18px; height:18px; stroke:#fff; }
  .feature-item h4{ font-size:0.98rem; margin-bottom:4px; }
  .feature-item p{ font-size:0.88rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  /* ---------- product tools ---------- */
  .tools-row{
    display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .search-box{
    flex: 1 1 260px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
    background: var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 12px 18px;
  }
  .search-box svg{ width:17px; height:17px; stroke: var(--ink-faint); flex-shrink:0; }
  .search-box input{
    border:none; background:transparent; outline:none; font-size:0.95rem; width:100%;
    font-family: var(--font-body); color: var(--ink);
  }
  .search-box input::placeholder{ color: var(--ink-faint); }

  .chip-row{ display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .chip{
    border:1px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:500; padding: 8px 14px; border-radius:999px;
    cursor:pointer; transition: background .15s, color .15s, border-color .15s;
  }
  .chip.active, .chip:hover{ background: var(--navy-deep); color:#fff; border-color: var(--navy-deep); }

  .product-grid{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 20px;
  }
  .product-card{
    background: var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-m);
    padding: 22px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;
    transition: border-color .15s, box-shadow .15s;
  }
  .product-card:hover{ border-color: var(--navy-deep); box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(16,21,28,0.07); }
  .product-card .icon-tile{
    width:52px; height:52px; border-radius: 13px; background: var(--bg);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  }
  .product-card .icon-tile svg{ width:26px; height:26px; stroke: var(--navy-deep); }
  .product-card h3{ font-size: 1.02rem; font-weight:600; }
  .product-card .desc{ font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--ink-soft); flex:1; }
  .product-card .card-foot{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; margin-top:4px; }
  .ill-tag{ font-size:0.68rem; color: var(--ink-faint); font-family: var(--font-mono); }
  .no-results{ text-align:center; padding: 48px 0; color: var(--ink-faint); display:none; }
  .no-results.show{ display:block; }

  /* ---------- hotels ---------- */
  .hotel-wrap{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr; gap: 56px; align-items:center; }
  .hotel-visual{
    background: var(--navy-deep); border-radius: var(--radius-l); padding: 40px;
    color:#fff; position:relative; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hotel-visual::before{
    content:''; position:absolute; inset:0;
    background: radial-gradient(320px 200px at 15% 10%, rgba(255,79,50,0.22), transparent 60%);
  }
  .hotel-visual .stat{ position:relative; margin-bottom: 26px; }
  .hotel-visual .stat:last-child{ margin-bottom:0; }
  .hotel-visual .stat h4{ color:#fff; font-size:1.05rem; margin-bottom:4px; }
  .hotel-visual .stat p{ color:#B8C4CF; font-size:0.88rem; }

  .benefit-list{ display:grid; gap:16px; }
  .benefit{
    display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start; background: var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-m); padding:18px 20px;
  }
  .benefit .ic{ width:34px; height:34px; border-radius:9px; background: var(--signal-soft); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0; }
  .benefit .ic svg{ width:17px; height:17px; stroke: var(--signal); }
  .benefit h4{ font-size:0.96rem; margin-bottom:3px; }
  .benefit p{ font-size:0.87rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .hotel-cta{ margin-top: 26px; display:flex; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap; }

  /* ---------- brands ---------- */
  .brand-note{
    display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start; background: var(--bg);
    border:1px dashed var(--ink-faint); border-radius: var(--radius-m); padding: 18px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 30px; font-size:0.88rem; color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .brand-note svg{ width:18px; height:18px; stroke: var(--navy-deep); flex-shrink:0; margin-top:2px; }
  .brand-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
  .brand-slot{
    border: 1.5px dashed var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-m);
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 24px 16px; text-align:center; color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size:0.85rem; font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
  .brand-slot strong{ display:block; font-family: var(--font-body); color: var(--ink-soft); font-size:0.9rem; margin-bottom:4px; }

  /* ---------- steps ---------- */
  .steps{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap:20px; counter-reset: step; }
  .step{ position:relative; padding-top: 8px; }
  .step::before{
    counter-increment: step; content: counter(step);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; background: var(--navy-deep); color:#fff;
    font-family: var(--font-head); font-weight:600; font-size:0.95rem; margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  .step h4{ font-size:1rem; margin-bottom:6px; }
  .step p{ font-size:0.88rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  section.dark .step p{ color:#B8C4CF; }

  /* ---------- contact ---------- */
  .contact-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap:18px; }
  .contact-card{
    background: var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-m);
    padding: 24px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;
  }
  .contact-card .ic{ width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:10px; background: var(--bg); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
  .contact-card .ic svg{ width:18px; height:18px; stroke: var(--navy-deep); }
  .contact-card h4{ font-size:0.95rem; }
  .contact-card a, .contact-card span.value{ font-size:0.88rem; color: var(--ink-soft); text-decoration:none; word-break:break-word; }
  .contact-card a:hover{ color: var(--navy-deep); text-decoration:underline; }
  .contact-card .placeholder{ color: var(--ink-faint); font-style: italic; }

  .quote-banner{
    margin-top: 56px; background: var(--navy-deep); border-radius: var(--radius-l);
    padding: 40px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:24px; flex-wrap:wrap;
    color:#fff;
  }
  .quote-banner h3{ color:#fff; font-size:1.3rem; max-width: 30ch; }
  .quote-banner p{ color:#B8C4CF; margin-top:6px; font-size:0.92rem; }

  /* ---------- footer ---------- */
  footer{ padding: 34px 0; }
  .footer-inner{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px; }
  .footer-inner p{ font-size:0.82rem; color: var(--ink-faint); }

  /* ---------- whatsapp float ---------- */
  .float-wa{
    position: fixed; right: 20px; bottom: 20px; z-index: 60;
    width: 56px; height:56px; border-radius:50%; background: var(--whatsapp);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(31,158,90,0.4);
    text-decoration:none;
  }
  .float-wa svg{ width:26px; height:26px; fill:#fff; }

  /* ---------- responsive ---------- */
  @media (max-width: 980px){
    .hero-inner, .about-grid, .hotel-wrap{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .remote-art{ order:-1; max-width: 260px; margin: 0 auto 12px; }
    .product-grid{ grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
    .steps{ grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
    .contact-grid, .brand-grid{ grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px){
    nav.primary-nav{
      position: fixed; inset: 62px 16px auto 16px; background: var(--surface);
      border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-m); padding: 10px;
      flex-direction: column; align-items:stretch; gap:2px;
      box-shadow: 0 16px 34px rgba(12,30,51,0.16);
      display:none;
    }
    nav.primary-nav.open{ display:flex; }
    nav.primary-nav a{ padding:12px 14px; border-radius: 10px; }
    .menu-toggle{ display:flex; }
    .topbar-actions .btn-ghost{ display:none; }
    .hero{ padding: 48px 0 56px; }
    section{ padding: 56px 0; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px){
    .product-grid{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .steps{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .contact-grid, .brand-grid{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .quote-banner{ flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ============ TOPO / NAVEGAÇÃO ============ -->
<header class="topbar">
  <div class="wrap topbar-inner">
    <a class="brand" href="#topo">
      <span class="brand-mark">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="8" y="2" width="8" height="20" rx="3" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="1.1" fill="#fff"/><line x1="9.5" y1="11" x2="14.5" y2="11" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="9.5" y1="14" x2="14.5" y2="14" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="9.5" y1="17" x2="14.5" y2="17" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
      </span>
      <span class="brand-name">Casa do Controle Remoto<span>Venda &amp; reposição de controles</span></span>
    </a>

    <nav class="primary-nav" id="primaryNav">
      <a href="#sobre">Sobre</a>
      <a href="#produtos">Produtos</a>
      <a href="#hoteis">Hotéis &amp; Pousadas</a>
      <a href="#marcas">Marcas</a>
      <a href="#comprar">Como comprar</a>
      <a href="#contato">Contato</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="topbar-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="https://casadocontroleremoto.com.br/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Site</a>
      <a class="btn btn-whatsapp btn-sm" id="navWaBtn" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#fff"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-8.6 15.1L2 22l5.1-1.3A10 10 0 1 0 12 2zm0 18.2a8.2 8.2 0 0 1-4.2-1.1l-.3-.2-3 .8.8-2.9-.2-.3A8.2 8.2 0 1 1 12 20.2zm4.5-6.1c-.2-.1-1.5-.7-1.7-.8-.2-.1-.4-.1-.6.1-.2.2-.7.8-.8 1-.1.2-.3.2-.5.1-.2-.1-1-.4-1.9-1.2-.7-.6-1.2-1.4-1.3-1.6-.1-.2 0-.4.1-.5.1-.1.2-.3.4-.4.1-.1.2-.2.2-.4.1-.1 0-.3 0-.4 0-.1-.6-1.5-.8-2-.2-.5-.4-.4-.6-.4h-.5c-.2 0-.4.1-.6.3-.2.2-.8.8-.8 1.9s.8 2.2.9 2.4c.1.2 1.6 2.5 4 3.5.6.2 1 .4 1.3.5.5.2 1 .1 1.4-.1.4-.2 1.2-.9 1.4-1.4.2-.5.2-.9.1-1z"/></svg>
        WhatsApp
      </a>
    </div>

    <button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle" aria-label="Abrir menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="primaryNav">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17324F" stroke-width="1.8"><line x1="4" y1="7" x2="20" y2="7"/><line x1="4" y1="12" x2="20" y2="12"/><line x1="4" y1="17" x2="20" y2="17"/></svg>
    </button>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ============ CAPA / HERO ============ -->
<section class="hero" id="topo">
  <div class="wrap hero-inner">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow-badge"><span class="dot"></span>Reposição rápida para hotéis, técnicos e lojistas</span>
      <h1>Seu controle, nossa especialidade.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Controles remotos originais e compatíveis para TVs, som, DVD, projetores, portões e alarmes. Um catálogo pensado para quem revende, instala ou administra um estabelecimento — e também para quem só precisa trocar o controle da sala.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-whatsapp" id="heroWaBtn" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#fff"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-8.6 15.1L2 22l5.1-1.3A10 10 0 1 0 12 2zm0 18.2a8.2 8.2 0 0 1-4.2-1.1l-.3-.2-3 .8.8-2.9-.2-.3A8.2 8.2 0 1 1 12 20.2z"/></svg>
          Solicitar orçamento
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#produtos">Ver produtos</a>
